{"2725610": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Haunted Bloodlines", "steam_appid": 2725610, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haunted Bloodlines is a first-person psychological horror game. Navigate a cursed family mansion that breathes, shifts and remembers, uncovering a buried legacy of secrets through exploration, time manipulation and two overlapping realities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENVIRONMENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mansion breathes. It shifts. It watches. Its history isn't hanging on the walls, it is the walls. And the further you explore, the clearer it becomes that the house isn't just showing you its past. It's deciding how much of your past to take.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725610/extras/81c25ca1199cbc384ff3cc070a862a16.poster.avif?t=1784924412\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725610/extras/81c25ca1199cbc384ff3cc070a862a16.webm?t=1784924412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725610/extras/81c25ca1199cbc384ff3cc070a862a16.mp4?t=1784924412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORYLINE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A family tore itself apart within these walls. Their diaries, their drawings, their secrets scattered and buried. Finding the truth means confronting something you weren't prepared for. This isn't just their story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725610/extras/cd75173df6db4edaee5f859f44b40f26.poster.avif?t=1784924412\" width=800 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725610/extras/cd75173df6db4edaee5f859f44b40f26.webm?t=1784924412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725610/extras/cd75173df6db4edaee5f859f44b40f26.mp4?t=1784924412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ESCAPE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have no weapons. No way to overpower what's here. Survival means staying quiet, staying hidden, and understanding that what hunts you knows this house far better than you ever will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725610/extras/386ca963754e1eab337ce659396eebfd.poster.avif?t=1784924412\" width=800 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725610/extras/386ca963754e1eab337ce659396eebfd.webm?t=1784924412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725610/extras/386ca963754e1eab337ce659396eebfd.mp4?t=1784924412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SANITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the more the house gets inside your head. Not all at once,  slowly, deliberately. A shadow that moves wrong. A sound from an empty room. The longer you stay, the more it rewrites what you're seeing and by the time you notice, it's already working.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725610/extras/cc7dadee42122f6a88c59a9b144418a9.poster.avif?t=1784924412\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725610/extras/cc7dadee42122f6a88c59a9b144418a9.webm?t=1784924412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725610/extras/cc7dadee42122f6a88c59a9b144418a9.mp4?t=1784924412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TIME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A pocket watch found deep inside the house carries an unusual power, the ability to glimpse moments that have already passed. Some secrets are buried in the past. Some can only be uncovered by going back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725610/extras/5d663791fd5b9b2441c8bee3453b8cd5.poster.avif?t=1784924412\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725610/extras/5d663791fd5b9b2441c8bee3453b8cd5.webm?t=1784924412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725610/extras/5d663791fd5b9b2441c8bee3453b8cd5.mp4?t=1784924412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>REALM-SWITCHING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The house exists in two states, the living and the dead, neither tells the whole story alone. Shifting between them reveals what each conceals. But don't mistake the dead realm for a tool. It has been there far longer than you have, and it does not see you as a visitor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725610/extras/f899a31eb5823bdaee0e7e32b1178645.poster.avif?t=1784924412\" width=800 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725610/extras/f899a31eb5823bdaee0e7e32b1178645.webm?t=1784924412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725610/extras/f899a31eb5823bdaee0e7e32b1178645.mp4?t=1784924412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725610/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.poster.avif?t=1784924412\" width=736 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725610/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.webm?t=1784924412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725610/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.mp4?t=1784924412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haunted Bloodlines is a first-person psychological horror game. Navigate a cursed family mansion that breathes, shifts and remembers, uncovering a buried legacy of secrets through exploration, time manipulation and two overlapping realities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENVIRONMENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mansion breathes. It shifts. It watches. Its history isn't hanging on the walls, it is the walls. And the further you explore, the clearer it becomes that the house isn't just showing you its past. It's deciding how much of your past to take.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725610/extras/81c25ca1199cbc384ff3cc070a862a16.poster.avif?t=1784924412\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725610/extras/81c25ca1199cbc384ff3cc070