apps/2725610/extras/386ca963754e1eab337ce659396eebfd.mp4?t=1784924412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SANITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the more the house gets inside your head. Not all at once,  slowly, deliberately. A shadow that moves wrong. A sound from an empty room. The longer you stay, the more it rewrites what you're seeing and by the time you notice, it's already working.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725610/extras/cc7dadee42122f6a88c59a9b144418a9.poster.avif?t=1784924412\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725610/extras/cc7dadee42122f6a88c59a9b144418a9.webm?t=1784924412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725610/extras/cc7dadee42122f6a88c59a9b144418a9.mp4?t=1784924412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TIME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A pocket watch found deep inside the house carries an unusual power, the ability to glimpse moments that have already passed. Some secrets are buried in the past. Some can only be uncovered by going back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725610/extras/5d663791fd5b9b2441c8bee3453b8cd5.poster.avif?t=1784924412\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725610/extras/5d663791fd5b9b2441c8bee3453b8cd5.webm?t=1784924412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725610/extras/5d663791fd5b9b2441c8bee3453b8cd5.mp4?t=1784924412\